{"id": "gmt-04", "title": "公告发布时间的多轮收窄", "scoring": "多轮对话上下文保持：日期替换、区间扩展、类型过滤叠加", "notes": "锚点 2026-10-17。第 2 轮是**替换**不是叠加；第 3 轮从单日扩成三天区间；第 4 轮才叠加类型过滤。真值：10-16 为 791 条、10-15 为 624 条、10-15~10-17 三天为 1969 条、其中招标公告 649 条。", "turns": [{"round": 1, "question": "2026-10-16 发布了多少条采购公告？", "expect_contains": ["791"], "depends_on_context": false, "expect_row_count": 1, "expect_columns": ["announcement_count"], "expect_sql_contains": [], "expect_sql_absent": []}, {"round": 2, "question": "改成 2026-10-15 呢？", "expect_contains": ["624"], "depends_on_context": true, "expect_row_count": 1, "expect_columns": ["announcement_count"], "expect_sql_contains": ["2026-10-15"], "expect_sql_absent": [], "note_sql_absent_fix": "2026-10-18 删除 expect_sql_absent=[\"2026-10-16\"]：半开区间写法 publish_date >= A AND publish_date < B 的上界必然是次日，SQL 里出现 2026-10-16 是正确行为。时间是否被替换由 expect_sql_contains=[\"2026-10-15\"] 保证。"}, {"round": 3, "question": "从 10 月 15 日到 17 日一共多少条？", "expect_contains": ["1969"], "depends_on_context": true, "expect_row_count": 1, "expect_columns": ["announcement_count"], "expect_sql_contains": ["2026-10-15", "2026-10-18"], "expect_sql_absent": []}, {"round": 4, "question": "其中招标公告有几条？", "expect_contains": ["649"], "depends_on_context": true, "expect_row_count": 1, "expect_columns": ["announcement_count"], "expect_sql_contains": ["招标公告", "2026-10-15"], "expect_sql_absent": []}, {"round": 5, "question": "按天分开看，每天各多少条？", "expect_contains": ["共 3 行"], "depends_on_context": true, "expect_row_count": 3, "expect_columns": ["publish_date", "announcement_count"], "expect_sql_contains": ["publish_date", "招标公告"], "expect_sql_absent": []}]}
